  "created": "2019-07-22T18:38:12.917Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "An custom feature for Dynamic bones have been put into VRChat.\n\nOne big problem im having in VRChat is ALOT of people use avatars that force shaders and other stuff on your screen. Like zooming in, fast color changes. Shaking and many others.\n\nAlot of this stuff makes me motion sick, dizzy or can even outright create an seizure for me and im sure other people.\n\nNot everybody respects or understand this. Specially not people that is not suffering from it. But from me that gets heavily effected i really want some kind of feature that enabled me to disable anything that forces your view to be manipulated in any way. Zooming, shaking, color changing or anything.\n\nIn VR this is really bad.\n\nI wanna be able to disable just that alone without having to permanently disable everybody's avatars and my friends. Cause it ruins the expirence to disable shaders and all that.\n\nSomething that protects me from these screen manipulating things.\n\nYou did a special setting for Dynamic Bones. Please do something for this. :c",
